       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             TINITWO.

       AUTHOR.                 W. ROXBURY.

       INSTALLATION.           GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
      *****************************************************************
      *REMARKS.            *** THIS PROGRAM INITIATES A WORK ORDER FROM
      *                        THE SUPERVISOR's FUNCTIONS PROGRAM (XSUPFUNC)
      *                        SUBROUTINES CALLED:
      *                            TADDWOVP
      *                            TNEWWONU
      *                            TPRINTWO
      *                            TWOTRACK
      *                            TQUPDATE
      *****************************************************************


      *****************************************************************
      **                   MODIFICATION   HISTORY
      *****************************************************************
      *   5/27/92  BK DISMUKES  REQUEST 6193
      *        1. ADDED LOGIC TO CHECK FOR SAFETY EQUIPMENT AND GIVE WO
      *           "DW" STATUS IF AGAINST SAFETY EQUIPMENT.
      *        2. ADDED LOGIC TO DENY REQUEST TO CREATE PLANNED OR
      *           ENGINEERED WO AGAINST SAFETY EQUIPMENT. MSG TO
      *           DISPLAY.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *   11/29/93  W. ROXBURY   SLS REQUEST 6446; CPE REQUEST 93-022
      *        ADDED ASBESTOS HAZARD FLAG FOR VERBAL WORKORDER CREATION
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      *    APR 20 2005  D. RAUCH     DCR02      REQUEST# 2005-78291
      *       1)  ADDED CALL TO CRAFT SELECTION PROGRAM - F6
      *       2)  ADDED CALL TO EQUIPMENT SELECTION PROGRAM - F5
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.          I-O-FEEDBACK     IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                               REQUESTOR        IS WORK-STATION
                               SYSTEM-CONSOLE   IS CONSOLE
                               LOCAL-DATA       IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT EQP-EQUIPMENT
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

           SELECT PER-PERSONNEL
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0301
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

           SELECT WO-CRAFTS-REQD
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

           SELECT WO-LAST-NUM-USED
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFPMM0800
                  ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
                  ACCESS MODE  IS RANDOM
                  RELATIVE KEY IS ARG-NO
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN       TO WORKSTATION-ZTINITWO-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS MODE  IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS  IS SCREEN-STATUS
                               MAJOR-MINOR
                  CONTROL-AREA IS SCREEN-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  EQP-EQUIPMENT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  EQP-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM0201.

       FD  PER-PERSONNEL
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  PER-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM0301.

       FD  WO-CRAFTS-REQD
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  WOR-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM0601.

       FD  WO-LAST-NUM-USED
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  WOLNU-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFPMM0800.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC         PIC X(2000).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  ARG-NO              PIC 9999  VALUE 1.
       77  CFT-BUF             PIC XX.
       77  ANSWER-FIELD        PIC X.
       77  DISP-DOTS           PIC X(40) VALUE ALL "*".
       77  ERROR-SW            PIC 9     VALUE 0.
       77  CRAFT-SW            PIC 9     VALUE 0.
       77  RESET-SW            PIC 9     VALUE 0.
       77  CONDIT-CODE         PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
       77  PRINT-SW            PIC S9(4) VALUE 0 BINARY.
       77  QUEUE-PRTY          PIC 9     VALUE ZEROS.
       77  QUEUE-SW            PIC X.
       77  QUEUE-ERROR         PIC X(76).
       77  ARG-KEY             PIC X(04).
       77  MSG-HOLD            PIC X(50).
       77  ERROR-SWITCH        PIC S9(4) VALUE ZEROS  BINARY.
       77  WORK-ORDER-NUMBER   PIC X(10).
       77  WO-ADD-SAVE         PIC X(7).
       77  TRUE-VAL            PIC 1     VALUE B"1".
       77  COM-TEXT            PIC X(22) VALUE " CRAFT REQUIRED ON WO.".


DCR01  01  WS-MY-MISC-FLDS.
DCR01      03  WS-EQUIP-SEL-PGM    PIC X(10) VALUE "SEQUIPSEL".
DCR01      03  WS-EQUIP-NBR        PIC X(06) VALUE SPACE.

DCR01      03  WS-CRAFT-SEL-PGM    PIC X(10) VALUE "SMCRAFT".
DCR01      03  WS-CRAFT            PIC X(06) VALUE SPACE.
DCR01      03  WS-CRAFT-FLAG       PIC X(06) VALUE SPACE.
DCR02      03  WS-CRAFT-DESC       PIC X(36) VALUE SPACE.
DCR02      03  WS-CRAFT-DISP       PIC X(01) VALUE "S".


       01  FILE-STAT.
           05 FILE-STAT-1      PIC X     VALUE "0".
           05 FILE-STAT-2      PIC X     VALUE "0".

       01  PASSWORD-INFORMATION.
           05  NAME-OF-PROGRAM     PIC X(08) VALUE "TINITWO ".
           05  PROGRAM-TYPE        PIC X(02) VALUE "UP".
           05  PROGRAM-RELEASE     PIC X(12) VALUE " J0100010001".
           05  PROGRAM-DESCRIPTION.
               10  PROG-DESC-A1    PIC X(30) VALUE
                   "INITIATE WORKORDERS FROM THE S".
               10  PROG-DESC-A2    PIC X(30) VALUE
                   "UPERVISOR's FUNCTIONS.        ".
               10  PROG-DESC-B1    PIC X(30) VALUE
                   "ALLOWS SUPERVISORS TO INITIATE".
               10  PROG-DESC-B2    PIC X(30) VALUE
                   " VERBAL OR PLANNED WO's.      ".
               10  PROG-FUNCTION1  PIC X(30) VALUE
                   "RUNS FROM f3 KEY OF SUPERVISOR".
               10  PROG-FUNCTION2  PIC X(30) VALUE
                   " FUNCTIONS MENU.              ".
           05  PASSWORD-FLAG       PIC X.

       01  SCREEN-DATA.
           05  REQR-BUF                 PIC X(16).
           05  EQP-NUM-BUF.
               10  EQP-NUM-BUF-1-2      PIC X(02).
               10  EQP-NUM-BUF-3-6      PIC X(04).
           05  PRTY-BUF                 PIC X.
           05  EQP-D-BUF                PIC X.
           05  WO-DESC-BUF              PIC X(30).
           05  CRAFT-BUF.
               10  CRAFT-1-BUF          PIC XX.
               10  CRAFT-2-BUF          PIC XX.
               10  CRAFT-3-BUF          PIC XX.
           05  DESC-2-BUF.
               10  DESC-2A-BUF          PIC X(66).
               10  DESC-2B-BUF          PIC X(66).
           05  ASB-MSG                  PIC X(36).
           05  ASBESTOS-SW              PIC X.
           05  PLANNED-SW               PIC X.
           05  Q-FACT.
               10  Q-CALC               PIC XX.
               10  Q-NEW                PIC XX.
           05  CC-ASGND                 PIC XXXX.
           05  MSG-BUF                  PIC X(50).
           05  CMDMSG                   PIC X(79).
           05  ERRMSG                   PIC X(79).

       01  COM-BUFF.
           05  CFT-SW          PIC X(02)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  COM-MSG         PIC X(22)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER          PIC X(326) VALUE SPACES.

       01  DB-ADD-MESSAGE.
           05  FILLER          PIC X(08).
           05  DB-ADD-MSG.
               10  FILLER      PIC X(12).
               10  WO-ADD      PIC X(07).
               10  FILLER      PIC X(23).

       01  TIME-BUFFER.
           05  CUR-TIME.
               10  CUR-HRS     PIC XX.
               10  CUR-MINS    PIC XX.
           05  CUR-SECS        PIC XXXX.

       01  DATE-BUF-CN.
           05  DBUF-CC         PIC XX.
           05  DATE-BUF.
               10  DBUF-YY     PIC XX.
               10  DBUF-MM     PIC XX.
               10  DBUF-DD     PIC XX.

       01  DATE-BUFFER.
           05  DATE-BUF-MM     PIC XX.
           05  SLASH1          PIC X.
           05  DATE-BUF-DD     PIC XX.
           05  SLASH2          PIC X.
           05  DATE-BUF-YY     PIC XX.

       01  DB-ERROR.
           05  DB-FUNC         PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           05  DB-FILE         PIC X(18) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER          PIC X(20) VALUE "ERROR - FILE-STAT = ".
           05  CON-WORD        PIC XX.

           COPY SCREENIO       IN COPYLIB.

           COPY CATREAD        IN COPYLIB.

           COPY JCWAREA        IN COPYLIB.

           COPY DBSTAT         IN COPYLIB.

       01  WO-EQUIP-DATA.
           COPY MEQPFILE       IN COPYLIB.

       01  WO-BASIC-DATA.
           COPY DWOBASIC       IN COPYLIB.

       01  WO-PLANNED-DATA.
           COPY DWOPLAN        IN COPYLIB.

       01  WO-PERS-DATA.
           COPY MPERSONL       IN COPYLIB.

       01  WO-QUEUE-DATA.
           COPY DWOOPENQ       IN COPYLIB.

       01  CRAFT-DATA.
           COPY MWOCRAFT       IN COPYLIB.

       01  LAST-WO-USED-DATA.
           COPY MLASTWO        IN COPYLIB.

       01  MESSAGE-DATA.
           COPY ERRORLIN       IN COPYLIB.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  DBPARAMETERS.
           COPY DBPARMS        IN COPYLIB.

       01  WO-TRACK-DATA.
           COPY DWOTRACK       IN COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION      USING DBPARAMETERS
                               WO-TRACK-DATA.

       CHECK-PASSWORD.
           CALL "TPWORD"       USING PASSWORD-INFORMATION.
           IF PASSWORD-FLAG NOT = "N"
               GO TO BEGIN.
           GOBACK.

       BEGIN.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           GO TO 6-MAIN.

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE               EQP-EQUIPMENT.
           CLOSE               PER-PERSONNEL.
           CLOSE               WO-CRAFTS-REQD.
           CLOSE               WO-LAST-NUM-USED.
           CLOSE               DISPLAY-FILE.
           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.
           OPEN INPUT          EQP-EQUIPMENT.
           OPEN INPUT          PER-PERSONNEL.
           OPEN INPUT          WO-CRAFTS-REQD.
           OPEN INPUT          WO-LAST-NUM-USED.
           OPEN I-O            DISPLAY-FILE.

           ACCEPT MC-LOCAL-DATA-AREA FROM LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
      ********************************************************
      **  IF JCW `PWOPRT' IS SET AT ANY NON BLANK VALUE, A  **
      **  COPY OF ANY PLANNED WORKORDER THAT IS INITIATED   **
      **  WILL PRINT AT THE DESIGNATED PLANNER'S PRINTER.   **
      ********************************************************
           IF JCW-PWOPRT-267 NOT = " "
               MOVE 1          TO PRINT-SW.

           MOVE SPACES         TO SCREEN-DATA.
           MOVE 0              TO KEY-HIT.
           ACCEPT TIME-BUFFER  FROM TIME.
           ACCEPT DATE-BUF     FROM DATE.
           MOVE "20"           TO DBUF-CC.
           IF DBUF-YY > 70
               MOVE "19"       TO DBUF-CC.
           MOVE DBUF-YY        TO DATE-BUF-YY.
           MOVE DBUF-MM        TO DATE-BUF-MM.
           MOVE DBUF-DD        TO DATE-BUF-DD.
           MOVE "/"            TO SLASH1 SLASH2.
           MOVE SPACES         TO LAST-WO-USED-DATA.

           READ  WO-LAST-NUM-USED INTO LAST-WO-USED-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "UNABLE TO GET LAST-WO-USED DATA."
                       "    FILE-STATUS = " FILE-STAT
               GO TO 2-EOJ.

       6-MAIN.
           IF KEY-HIT = 1 OR 3
               GO TO 2-EOJ.

           MOVE "INITWO  "     TO SCREEN-NAME.
           MOVE MSG-BUF        TO MSG-HOLD.
           MOVE SPACES         TO SCREEN-DATA MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           MOVE MSG-HOLD       TO MSG-BUF.
      ********************************************************
      **  IF JCW 'ASBSTS' IS SET AT ANY NON BLANK VALUE, A  **
      **  COPY OF ANY VERBAL WORKORDER THAT IS INITIATED    **
      **  WILL PRINT AT THE DESIGNATED ASBESTOS PRINTER.    **
      **  MUST BE A RECORD 'ABST' IN ZONPRT DATABASE.       **
      ********************************************************
           IF JCW-ASBSTS-306 > " "
               MOVE "Enter X to identify ASBESTOS hazard:"
                               TO ASB-MSG.

           IF PLANT-IDENT = "153 "
               MOVE "MT"       TO CRAFT-1-BUF.

       61-SHOWFORM.
           IF JCW-ASBSTS-306 > " "
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(80).

           MOVE "00"           TO SCREEN-STATUS.
           MOVE SCREEN-DATA    TO DISPLAY-REC.

           WRITE DISPLAY-REC   FORMAT IS SCREEN-NAME
               INDIC ARE SCREEN-INDICATORS.
           IF SCREEN-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "SCREEN WRITE ERROR.  SCREEN-STATUS IS "
                        SCREEN-STATUS
               GO TO 2-EOJ.

           READ  DISPLAY-FILE  FORMAT IS SCREEN-NAME
               INDIC ARE SCREEN-INDICATORS
           IF SCREEN-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "SCREEN READ ERROR.  SCREEN-STATUS IS "
                        SCREEN-STATUS
               GO TO 2-EOJ.

           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO SCREEN-DATA.
           MOVE ALL B"0"       TO SCREEN-INDICATORS.
           MOVE 0              TO RESET-SW.

           IF KEY-HIT = 1 OR 3
               GO TO 2-EOJ.

           IF KEY-HIT = 2
               MOVE 1          TO RESET-SW
               MOVE 0          TO KEY-HIT.

DCR01      IF KEY-HIT = 5
DCR01         PERFORM 800-CALL-EQUIP-SELECTION  THRU 800-EQP-XIT
DCR01         GO TO 61-SHOWFORM
DCR01      END-IF.

DCR01      IF KEY-HIT = 6
DCR01         PERFORM 800-CALL-CRAFT-SELECTION  THRU 800-CFT-XIT
DCR01         GO TO 61-SHOWFORM
DCR01      END-IF.

           IF PLANNED-SW = "X"
               MOVE 0          TO RESET-SW
               PERFORM 61-EDIT-CHECKS THRU 61-EC-EXIT
               PERFORM 62-PL-DB-WRITE
           ELSE
               PERFORM 61-EDIT-CHECKS THRU 61-EC-EXIT
               PERFORM 62-BA-DB-WRITE
               IF WO-STATUS = "OO"
                   PERFORM 63-WRITE-QUEUE
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE.

      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 049/007:
      ** WORKORDER #XXXXXXXXXX HAS BEEN ADDED
      **********************************************************************
           MOVE  49            TO CATREAD-MSG-SET.
           MOVE   7            TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE SPACES         TO DB-ADD-MESSAGE.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DB-ADD-MSG.
           MOVE WO-ADD-SAVE    TO WO-ADD.
           MOVE DB-ADD-MESSAGE TO MSG-BUF.
           GO TO 6-MAIN.

       61-EDIT-CHECKS.
           IF REQR-BUF = SPACES
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 044/028:
      **  REQUESTER REQUIRED
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  44        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  28        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 1          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           IF EQP-NUM-BUF = SPACES
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 031/016:
      **  EQUIPMENT NUMBER IS REQUIRED
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  31        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  16        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 2          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           MOVE EQP-NUM-BUF    TO EQPNUM OF EQP-EQUIPMENT.
           READ EQP-EQUIPMENT  INTO WO-EQUIP-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
             IF FILE-STAT-1 = "2"
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 035/004:
      **  INVALID EQUIPMENT NUMBER
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  35        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE   4        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 2          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = 0
               MOVE FILE-STAT  TO CON-WORD
               MOVE "READ    " TO DB-FUNC
               MOVE "EQP-EQUIPMENT" TO DB-FILE
               MOVE 2          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               MOVE DB-ERROR   TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           IF PLANNED-SW     = "X" AND
              EQP-SAFETY-FLG = "X"
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 029/125:
      **  CANNOT CREATE PLANNED/ENGINEERED WO AGAINST SAFETY EQUIPMENT
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  29        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  125       TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 2          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           IF PRTY-BUF = SPACES
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 042/052:
      **  PRIORITY REQUIRED
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  42        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  52        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 15         TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           IF PRTY-BUF < "1" OR > "6"
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 035/080:
      **  INVALID PRIORITY
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  35        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  80        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 15         TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           IF EQP-D-BUF = "Y" OR "N"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 039/032:
      **  MUST ENTER 'Y' OR 'N'
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  39        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  32        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 4          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           IF EQP-D-BUF = "Y"
               MOVE "1"        TO PRTY-BUF.

           IF PRTY-BUF = "1" AND EQP-D-BUF = "N"
               MOVE "2"        TO PRTY-BUF.

           IF WO-DESC-BUF = SPACES
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 030/042:
      **  DESCRIPTION REQUIRED
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  30        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  42        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 8          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           IF PLANNED-SW = "X"
               MOVE SPACES     TO CRAFT-BUF
               GO TO 61-EC-EXIT.

           IF CRAFT-BUF = SPACES
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 041/004:
      **  ONE SKILL CODE REQUIRED
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  41        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE   4        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 5          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

      ************************************************************
      ***   SPECIAL CODE ADDED FOR GADSDEN FOR TEMPORARY       ***
      ***   TRANSITION TO A SINGLE `GM' CRAFT DESIGNATION      ***
      ************************************************************
           IF PLANT-IDENT = "131 "
               IF CRAFT-1-BUF = "MW" OR "PF" OR "WL" OR "SM"
                   MOVE "GM"   TO CRAFT-3-BUF.

           IF PLANT-IDENT = "131 "
               IF CRAFT-2-BUF = "MW" OR "PF" OR "WL" OR "SM"
                   MOVE "GM"   TO CRAFT-3-BUF.

           IF PLANT-IDENT = "131 "
               IF CRAFT-3-BUF = "MW" OR "PF" OR "WL" OR "SM"
                   MOVE "GM"   TO CRAFT-3-BUF.
      ************************************************************

           IF CRAFT-1-BUF = SPACES
               MOVE CRAFT-2-BUF TO CRAFT-1-BUF
               MOVE CRAFT-3-BUF TO CRAFT-2-BUF
               MOVE SPACES      TO CRAFT-3-BUF.

           IF CRAFT-1-BUF = SPACES
               MOVE CRAFT-2-BUF TO CRAFT-1-BUF
               MOVE CRAFT-3-BUF TO CRAFT-2-BUF
               MOVE SPACES      TO CRAFT-3-BUF.

           IF CRAFT-2-BUF = SPACES
               MOVE CRAFT-3-BUF TO CRAFT-2-BUF
               MOVE SPACES      TO CRAFT-3-BUF.

      **MOVED THE FOLLOWING THREE SENTENCES HERE FROM AFTER THE EDITS.**
           IF CRAFT-1-BUF = CRAFT-2-BUF
               MOVE CRAFT-3-BUF TO CRAFT-2-BUF
               MOVE SPACES      TO CRAFT-3-BUF.

           IF CRAFT-1-BUF = CRAFT-2-BUF
               MOVE CRAFT-3-BUF TO CRAFT-2-BUF
               MOVE SPACES      TO CRAFT-3-BUF.

           IF CRAFT-2-BUF = CRAFT-3-BUF
               MOVE SPACES      TO CRAFT-3-BUF.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE 0              TO ERROR-SW CRAFT-SW.
           MOVE CRAFT-1-BUF    TO CFT-BUF.
           PERFORM 64-CRAFT-VALIDATION.
           IF CRAFT-FLAG = "1"
               MOVE 1          TO CRAFT-SW.

           IF ERROR-SW = 1
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 035/035:
      **  INVALID SKILL
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  35        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  35        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 5          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           IF CRAFT-2-BUF NOT = SPACES
               MOVE CRAFT-2-BUF TO CFT-BUF
               PERFORM 64-CRAFT-VALIDATION
               IF ERROR-SW = 1
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 035/035:
      **  INVALID SKILL
      **********************************************************************
                   MOVE  35    TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
                   MOVE  35    TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE 6      TO FIELD-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 65-ERROR
                   GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           IF CRAFT-3-BUF NOT = SPACES
               MOVE CRAFT-3-BUF TO CFT-BUF
               PERFORM 64-CRAFT-VALIDATION
               IF ERROR-SW = 1
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 035/035:
      **  INVALID SKILL
      **********************************************************************
                   MOVE  35    TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
                   MOVE  35    TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE 7      TO FIELD-NUMBER
                   PERFORM 65-ERROR
                   GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

       61-EC-EXIT.             EXIT.

       62-BA-DB-WRITE.
           ACCEPT TIME-BUFFER  FROM TIME.
           ACCEPT DATE-BUF     FROM DATE.
           MOVE "20"           TO DBUF-CC.
           IF DBUF-YY > 70
               MOVE "19"       TO DBUF-CC.

           CALL "TNEWWONU"     USING DBPARAMETERS
                               STATUS-AREA
                               WORK-ORDER-NUMBER
                               ERROR-SWITCH.
           MOVE WORK-ORDER-NUMBER TO WO-ADD-SAVE.

           IF ERROR-SWITCH NOT = 0
               MOVE "TNEWWONU" TO DB-FUNC
               MOVE SPACES     TO DB-FILE
               MOVE ERROR-SWITCH TO CON-WORD
               MOVE DB-ERROR   TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               DISPLAY DISP-DOTS
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "  PLEASE NOTIFY MMIS SYSTEM MANAGER OR"
               DISPLAY "  HP SYSTEM OPERATOR OF THE FOLLOWING:"
               DISPLAY "  PROGRAM NAME:  TINITWO OF XSUPFUNC"
               DISPLAY "  SUBROUTINE:    TNEWWONU"
               DISPLAY "  " DB-ERROR
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY DISP-DOTS
               DISPLAY "    "
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           MOVE SPACES         TO WO-BASIC-DATA.
           MOVE WORK-ORDER-NUMBER TO WO-NUM.
           IF EQP-SAFETY-FLG = "X"
               MOVE "DW"       TO WO-STATUS
               MOVE DATE-BUF-CN TO DATE-COMP-CN, DATE-STRT-CN
               MOVE CUR-TIME   TO TIME-COMP, TIME-STRT
               MOVE "N"        TO EQUIP-DOWN
               MOVE "090000"   TO FAILURE-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE EQP-D-BUF  TO EQUIP-DOWN
               MOVE "OO"       TO WO-STATUS.

           IF PLANT-IDENT = "126 "
               IF PRTY-BUF = "4" OR "5" OR "6"
                   MOVE "HL"   TO WO-STATUS.

           MOVE DATE-BUF-CN    TO DATE-RECD-CN.
           MOVE CUR-TIME       TO TIME-RECD.
           MOVE "A"            TO APPROVAL-CODE.
           MOVE REQR-BUF       TO REQUESTER-B.
           MOVE EQP-NUM-BUF    TO EQUIP-NUM.
           MOVE EQP-EQUIP-NAME TO EQUIP-NAME.
           MOVE EQP-TYPE       TO TYPE-NUM.
           MOVE EQP-DEPT       TO DEPT.
           MOVE EQP-EXP-CLASS  TO EXP-CLASS.
           MOVE EQP-MAINT-ZONE TO ZONE.
           MOVE PRTY-BUF       TO PRIORITY.
           MOVE EQP-LOCATION   TO LOCATION.
           MOVE WO-DESC-BUF    TO DESCRIPTION-1.
           MOVE DESC-2-BUF     TO DESCRIPTION-2.
           MOVE CRAFT-1-BUF    TO CRAFTS-REQD-1.
           MOVE CRAFT-2-BUF    TO CRAFTS-REQD-2.
           MOVE CRAFT-3-BUF    TO CRAFTS-REQD-3.
           MOVE "VV"           TO WO-STRT-STATUS.

           CALL "TADDWO"       USING DBPARAMETERS
                               WO-BASIC-DATA
                               CONDIT-CODE
                               ERROR-SWITCH.

           IF ERROR-SWITCH NOT = 0
               MOVE "TADDWO  " TO DB-FUNC
               MOVE SPACES     TO DB-FILE
               MOVE ERROR-SWITCH TO CON-WORD
               MOVE DB-ERROR   TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               DISPLAY DISP-DOTS
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "  PLEASE NOTIFY MMIS SYSTEM MANAGER OR"
               DISPLAY "  HP SYSTEM OPERATOR OF THE FOLLOWING:"
               DISPLAY "  PROGRAM NAME:  TINITWO OF XSUPFUNC"
               DISPLAY "  SUBROUTINE:    TADDWOVP"
               DISPLAY "  " DB-ERROR
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY DISP-DOTS
               DISPLAY "    "
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           MOVE SPACES         TO T-WO-DATA T-STATUS-DATA.
           MOVE "TINITWO "     TO PROGRAM-NAME.
           MOVE WO-NUM         TO WO-NUM-TRACK.
           MOVE DATE-RECD-CN   TO DATE-STAMP-CN.
           MOVE TIME-RECD      TO TIME-STAMP.
           MOVE WO-STRT-STATUS TO WO-TYPE-STATUS.
           MOVE "SUPV"         TO USER-ID.
           MOVE SPACES         TO CLOCK-CARD.
           MOVE WO-STATUS      TO WO-STATUS-TRACK.
           MOVE "OO"           TO TRANS-STATUS.
           CALL "TWOTRACK"     USING WO-TRACK-DATA.
           IF CRAFT-SW = 1
               MOVE "1"        TO RETURN-BYTE
               MOVE CRAFTS-REQD-1 TO ZONE CFT-SW
               MOVE COM-TEXT   TO COM-MSG
               CALL "TPRINTWO" USING WO-BASIC-DATA
                               DBPARAMETERS
                               COM-BUFF
               MOVE EQP-MAINT-ZONE TO ZONE.

           IF ASBESTOS-SW > " "
               MOVE "1"        TO RETURN-BYTE
               MOVE "ABST"     TO ZONE
               MOVE SPACES     TO COM-BUFF
               CALL "TPRINTWO" USING WO-BASIC-DATA
                               DBPARAMETERS
                               COM-BUFF
               MOVE EQP-MAINT-ZONE TO ZONE.

       62-PL-DB-WRITE.
           ACCEPT TIME-BUFFER  FROM TIME.
           ACCEPT DATE-BUF     FROM DATE.
           MOVE "20"           TO DBUF-CC.
           IF DBUF-YY > 70
               MOVE "19"       TO DBUF-CC.

           CALL "TNEWWONU"     USING DBPARAMETERS
                               STATUS-AREA
                               WORK-ORDER-NUMBER
                               ERROR-SWITCH.
           MOVE WORK-ORDER-NUMBER TO WO-ADD-SAVE.

           IF ERROR-SWITCH NOT = 0
               MOVE "TADDWOII" TO DB-FUNC
               MOVE SPACES     TO DB-FILE
               MOVE ERROR-SWITCH TO CON-WORD
               MOVE DB-ERROR   TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               DISPLAY DISP-DOTS
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "  PLEASE NOTIFY MMIS SYSTEM MANAGER OR"
               DISPLAY "  HP SYSTEM OPERATOR OF THE FOLLOWING:"
               DISPLAY "  PROGRAM NAME:  TXINITWO OF XSUPFUNC"
               DISPLAY "  SUBROUTINE:    TNEWWONU"
               DISPLAY "  " DB-ERROR
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY DISP-DOTS
               DISPLAY "    "
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           MOVE SPACES         TO WO-PLANNED-DATA.
           MOVE WORK-ORDER-NUMBER TO WO-NUM-PLANNED.
           MOVE "OO"           TO WO-STATUS-P.
           MOVE DATE-BUF-CN    TO DATE-RECD-P-CN.
           MOVE CUR-TIME       TO TIME-RECD-P.
           MOVE "U"            TO APPROVAL-CODE-P.
           MOVE REQR-BUF       TO REQUESTER-P.
           MOVE EQP-NUM-BUF    TO EQUIP-NUM-P.
           MOVE EQP-EQUIP-NAME TO EQUIP-NAME-P.
           MOVE EQP-TYPE       TO TYPE-NUM-P.
           MOVE EQP-DEPT       TO DEPT-P.
           MOVE EQP-EXP-CLASS  TO EXP-CLASS-P.
           MOVE EQP-MAINT-ZONE TO ZONE-P.
           MOVE PRTY-BUF       TO PRIORITY-P.
           MOVE EQP-LOCATION   TO LOCATION-P.
           MOVE EQP-D-BUF      TO EQUIP-DOWN-P.
           MOVE WO-DESC-BUF    TO DESCRIPTION-1-P.
           MOVE DESC-2-BUF     TO DESCRIPTION-2-P.
           MOVE "PP"           TO WO-START-STATUS.
           MOVE "INIT"         TO PLANNER-P.

           CALL "TADDWOII"     USING DBPARAMETERS
                               STATUS-AREA
                               WO-PLANNED-DATA
                               CONDIT-CODE
                               ERROR-SWITCH.

           IF ERROR-SWITCH NOT = 0
               MOVE "TADDWOII" TO DB-FUNC
               MOVE SPACES     TO DB-FILE
               MOVE ERROR-SWITCH TO CON-WORD
               MOVE DB-ERROR   TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               DISPLAY DISP-DOTS
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "  PLEASE NOTIFY MMIS SYSTEM MANAGER OR"
               DISPLAY "  HP SYSTEM OPERATOR OF THE FOLLOWING:"
               DISPLAY "  PROGRAM NAME:  TXINITWO OF XSUPFUNC"
               DISPLAY "  SUBROUTINE:    TADDWOVP"
               DISPLAY "  " DB-ERROR
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY DISP-DOTS
               DISPLAY "    "
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

           MOVE SPACES         TO T-WO-DATA T-STATUS-DATA.
           MOVE "TXINITWO"     TO PROGRAM-NAME.
           MOVE WO-NUM-PLANNED TO WO-NUM-TRACK.
           MOVE DATE-RECD-P-CN TO DATE-STAMP-CN.
           MOVE TIME-RECD-P    TO TIME-STAMP.
           MOVE WO-START-STATUS TO WO-TYPE-STATUS.
           MOVE "EXEC"         TO USER-ID.
           MOVE SPACES         TO CLOCK-CARD.
           MOVE WO-STATUS-P    TO WO-STATUS-TRACK TRANS-STATUS.
           CALL "TWOTRACK"     USING WO-TRACK-DATA.

           IF PRINT-SW = 1
               MOVE SPACES             TO WO-BASIC-DATA
               MOVE WO-NUM-PLANNED     TO WO-NUM
               MOVE WO-STATUS-P        TO WO-STATUS
               MOVE WO-START-STATUS    TO WO-STRT-STATUS
               MOVE DATE-RECD-P-CN     TO DATE-RECD-CN
               MOVE TIME-RECD-P        TO TIME-RECD
               MOVE APPROVAL-CODE-P    TO APPROVAL-CODE
               MOVE REQUESTER-P        TO REQUESTER-B
               MOVE EQUIP-NUM-P        TO EQUIP-NUM
               MOVE EQUIP-NAME-P       TO EQUIP-NAME
               MOVE TYPE-NUM-P         TO TYPE-NUM
               MOVE DEPT-P             TO DEPT
               MOVE ZONE-PRIORITY-P    TO ZONE-PRIORITY
               MOVE LOCATION-P         TO LOCATION
               MOVE EQUIP-DOWN-P       TO EQUIP-DOWN
               MOVE EXP-CLASS-P        TO EXP-CLASS
               MOVE DESCRIPTION-1-P    TO DESCRIPTION-1
               MOVE DESCRIPTION-2-1-P  TO DESCRIPTION-2-1
               MOVE DESCRIPTION-2-2-P  TO DESCRIPTION-2-2
               MOVE DATE-STRT-P-CN     TO DATE-STRT-CN
               MOVE TIME-STRT-P        TO TIME-STRT
               MOVE DATE-COMP-P-CN     TO DATE-COMP-CN
               MOVE TIME-COMP-P        TO TIME-COMP
               MOVE ALL "*"            TO CRAFTS-REQD-1
               MOVE ALL "*"            TO CRAFTS-REQD-2
               MOVE ALL "*"            TO CRAFTS-REQD-3
               MOVE ALL "*"            TO CRAFTSMEN-1
               MOVE ALL "*"            TO CRAFTSMEN-2
               MOVE ALL "*"            TO CRAFTSMEN-3
               MOVE "2"                TO RETURN-BYTE
               MOVE SPACES             TO COM-BUFF
               CALL "TPRINTWO" USING WO-BASIC-DATA
                               DBPARAMETERS
                               COM-BUFF.

       63-WRITE-QUEUE.
           MOVE SPACES         TO WO-QUEUE-DATA.
           MOVE ZONE           TO Q-ZONE.
           MOVE PRIORITY       TO Q-PRTY.
           MOVE WO-NUM         TO Q-WO-NUM.
           MOVE EQUIP-DOWN     TO Q-EQP-DOWN.
           MOVE "9999"         TO Q-CC-NUM.
           MOVE EQUIP-NUM      TO Q-EQUIP-NUM.
           MOVE DESCRIPTION-1  TO Q-DESCRIPTION.
           MOVE CRAFTS-REQD-1  TO Q-SKILL-1.
           MOVE CRAFTS-REQD-2  TO Q-SKILL-2.
           MOVE CRAFTS-REQD-3  TO Q-SKILL-3.
           IF PRIORITY = "1 "  MOVE 9 TO QUEUE-PRTY.
           IF PRIORITY = "2 "  MOVE 6 TO QUEUE-PRTY.
           IF PRIORITY = "3 "  MOVE 4 TO QUEUE-PRTY.
           IF PRIORITY = "4 "  MOVE 2 TO QUEUE-PRTY.
           IF PRIORITY = "5 "  MOVE 1 TO QUEUE-PRTY.

           COMPUTE QUEUE-FACTOR = RIME-NO * QUEUE-PRTY.
           PERFORM 63-Q-REQUEST THRU 63-QR-EXIT.

           MOVE "A"            TO QUEUE-SW.
           CALL "TQUPDATE"     USING DBPARAMETERS
                               WO-QUEUE-DATA
                               QUEUE-SW
                               QUEUE-ERROR.
           IF QUEUE-ERROR NOT = SPACES
               MOVE QUEUE-ERROR TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               MOVE 1          TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

       63-Q-REQUEST.
           MOVE QUEUE-FACTOR   TO Q-CALC.
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 049/007:
      **  WORKORDER #XXXXXXXXXX HAS BEEN ADDED
      **********************************************************************
           MOVE  49            TO CATREAD-MSG-SET.
           MOVE   7            TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE SPACES         TO DB-ADD-MESSAGE.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DB-ADD-MSG.
           MOVE WO-ADD-SAVE    TO WO-ADD.
           MOVE DB-ADD-MESSAGE TO MSG-BUF.
           IF RESET-SW = 0
               GO TO 63-QR-EXIT.
           MOVE "INITWOSON"    TO SCREEN-NAME.

       63-SHOWFORM.
           MOVE "00"           TO SCREEN-STATUS.
           MOVE SCREEN-DATA    TO DISPLAY-REC.

           WRITE DISPLAY-REC   FORMAT IS SCREEN-NAME
               INDIC ARE SCREEN-INDICATORS.
           IF SCREEN-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "SCREEN WRITE ERROR.  SCREEN-STATUS IS "
                        SCREEN-STATUS
               GO TO 2-EOJ.

           READ  DISPLAY-FILE  FORMAT IS SCREEN-NAME
               INDIC ARE SCREEN-INDICATORS
           IF SCREEN-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "SCREEN READ ERROR.  SCREEN-STATUS IS "
                        SCREEN-STATUS
               GO TO 2-EOJ.

           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO SCREEN-DATA.
           MOVE ALL B"0"       TO SCREEN-INDICATORS.

           IF KEY-HIT = 1 OR 3
               GO TO 63-QR-EXIT.

           IF KEY-HIT NOT = 0
               GO TO 63-SHOWFORM.

       63-Q-EDIT.
           IF Q-NEW = SPACES   GO TO 63-Q-EDIT-CONT.
           IF Q-NEW NOT NUMERIC
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 035/050:
      **  INVALID QUEUE FACTOR - MUST BE NUMERIC
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  35        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  50        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 17         TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 63-SHOWFORM
           ELSE
           IF Q-NEW > 81
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 035/051:
      **  INVALID QUEUE FACTOR - MUST BE 81 OR LESS
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  35        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  51        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 17         TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 63-SHOWFORM
           ELSE
           IF Q-NEW = 79 OR 80
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 032/002:
      **  FACTORS 79 AND 80 ARE RESERVED FOR HOT CODES
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  32        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE   2        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 17         TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 63-SHOWFORM.

           MOVE Q-NEW          TO QUEUE-FACTOR.

       63-Q-EDIT-CONT.
           IF CC-ASGND = SPACES GO TO 63-QR-EXIT.
           IF CC-ASGND = "NEWS" OR "9999"
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 035/047:
      **  INVALID CLOCK CARD NUMBER
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  35        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  47        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 18         TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 63-SHOWFORM.

           MOVE CC-ASGND       TO PERCCNUM OF PER-PERSONNEL.
           READ PER-PERSONNEL  INTO WO-PERS-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
             IF FILE-STAT-1 = "2"
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 035/047:
      **  INVALID CLOCK CARD NUMBER
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  35        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  47        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE 18         TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 63-SHOWFORM
             ELSE
               MOVE FILE-STAT  TO CON-WORD
               MOVE "READ    " TO DB-FUNC
               MOVE "PER-PERSONNEL" TO DB-FILE
               MOVE DB-ERROR   TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               MOVE 18         TO FIELD-NUMBER
               PERFORM 65-ERROR
               GO TO 63-SHOWFORM.

           MOVE CC-ASGND       TO Q-CC-NUM.

       63-QR-EXIT.             EXIT.

       64-CRAFT-VALIDATION.
           MOVE CFT-BUF        TO CRAFTREQD OF WO-CRAFTS-REQD.
           READ WO-CRAFTS-REQD INTO CRAFT-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
             IF FILE-STAT-1 = "2"
               MOVE 1          TO ERROR-SW
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = 0
               MOVE FILE-STAT  TO CON-WORD
               MOVE "READ    " TO DB-FUNC
               MOVE "WO-CRAFTS-REQD" TO DB-FILE
               MOVE DB-ERROR   TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               GO TO 61-SHOWFORM.

       65-ERROR.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERRMSG.
           MOVE TRUE-VAL       TO IND(FIELD-NUMBER) IND(99).

      *****************************************************************
      ** CALL EQUIPMENT SELECTION PGM
      *****************************************************************
DCR01  800-CALL-EQUIP-SELECTION.

           MOVE SPACE         TO  WS-EQUIP-NBR.
           CALL WS-EQUIP-SEL-PGM  USING WS-EQUIP-NBR.

           IF WS-EQUIP-NBR NOT = SPACES
              MOVE WS-EQUIP-NBR  TO EQP-NUM-BUF
           END-IF.

DCR01  800-EQP-XIT.
DCR01       EXIT.


      *****************************************************************
      ** CALL CRAFT SELECTION PGM
      *****************************************************************
DCR01  800-CALL-CRAFT-SELECTION.

           MOVE SPACE         TO  WS-CRAFT.
           MOVE SPACE         TO  WS-CRAFT-FLAG.
           MOVE SPACE         TO  WS-CRAFT-DESC.
           MOVE "S"           TO  WS-CRAFT-DISP.
           CALL WS-CRAFT-SEL-PGM  USING WS-CRAFT  WS-CRAFT-FLAG
                                        WS-CRAFT-DESC   WS-CRAFT-DISP.

           IF WS-CRAFT(1:2) NOT = SPACES
              MOVE WS-CRAFT(1:2) TO CRAFT-1-BUF
           END-IF.

           IF WS-CRAFT(3:2) NOT = SPACES
              MOVE WS-CRAFT(3:2) TO CRAFT-2-BUF
           END-IF.

           IF WS-CRAFT(5:2) NOT = SPACES
              MOVE WS-CRAFT(5:2) TO CRAFT-3-BUF
           END-IF.

DCR01  800-CFT-XIT.
DCR01       EXIT.

       999-CATREAD.
           MOVE SPACES         TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           CALL "CCATREAD"     USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       999-CATREAD-EXIT.       EXIT.

